category: Net
build-depends: cygport libfpconv-devel libhdr_histogram-devel liblinenoise-devel libssl-devel libvalkey-devel libvalkey_tls-devel libtcmalloc-devel tcl
sdesc: "Flexible distributed key-value datastore"
ldesc: "Valkey is a high-performance data structure server that primarily serves
key/value workloads. It supports a wide range of native structures and an
extensible plugin system for adding new data structures and access patterns."
